  "reason": "Evidence: config_024 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted) is the clear best at 0.725 acc, and weighted fusion has outperformed concat in all 3 prior comparisons (config_019 vs 020, config_016 vs 017-implied, config_045 vs 023-implied). The only untested variant in this top-performing family is config_018 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + concat). This experiment tests whether concat fusion could unexpectedly match or exceed weighted in the scvi_n200 regime, fully characterizing the best architecture family. If it confirms weighted > concat (as expected), we can confidently lock in config_024 as the family optimum and use the remaining 3 experiments to explore whether single-profile or other structural changes could push accuracy higher. Expected cost is moderate (~3.5–4 GPU hours), comparable to config_024's 3.60 GPU hours, since it uses the same encoders and transformer aggregation with only a fusion change."
